brown-foods|GENERIC||None||Cell-cultured cow and human milk|cellular agriculture wet lab, no ML proof point|Cultured milk costs depend on growth media prices and cell density at bioreactor scale.
snappr|GENERIC||None|PHYS|Photography marketplace and automated visual content workflows|creative services marketplace, perception overlap is minor|Automating brand image pipelines depends on editing models that hold consistent style across thousands of products.
snaptrade|GENERIC||None||API connecting retail brokerage accounts to fintech apps|brokerage data APIs, no matching proof point|Brokerage connections break whenever institutions change their auth flows, so maintenance load is the hard part.
standard-ai|PHYS||Strong||Camera-based checkout-free retail|tracking shoppers and products with ceiling cameras = perception -> P2|Checkout-free stores depend on tracking which shopper took which item through occlusion in crowded aisles.
hypercore|GENERIC||None||Loan management software for private lenders|lending software, no matching proof point|Private lenders run bespoke loan terms that most servicing software cannot represent without custom fields.
confido|RAG|P3|Moderate|AGENT_EVAL|Automating cash application and retailer deductions for CPG brands|deduction disputes depend on reading retailer documents and invoices -> P4|Deduction disputes are won by matching retailer backup documents to the right invoice, promotion and proof of delivery.
rutter|GENERIC||None||Unified API for business financial data|integration API, no matching proof point|A single schema across accounting and commerce platforms has to preserve detail that each source models differently.
encord|PHYS_EVAL||Strong|PHYS|Data curation and annotation platform for physical AI models|training data for robots and AVs = perception data plus evals -> P2+P3|Curating multimodal robot data means finding the rare edge cases that actually move policy performance.
facio|GENERIC||None||Salary advances for employees in Brazil|earned wage access fintech, no matching proof point|Salary advances depend on payroll integrations that confirm employment and pay dates in real time.
centralize|GENERIC||None||Relationship graph showing reps who they know in each deal|sales intelligence SaaS, no matching proof point|Relationship graphs are only useful when they infer real trust from email and calendar signals, beyond mere contact.
uselemma|AGENT_EVAL||Strong||Production monitoring that catches silent semantic failures in AI agents|semantic failure detection on agent traces = agent evals -> P3|Silent agent failures look like success in logs, so detecting them requires judging each trace against user intent.
fleetzero|PHYS||Moderate|GENERIC|Autonomous cargo ships|autonomous navigation at sea = perception and autonomy -> P2|Autonomous ships need perception that detects small vessels and debris in fog, glare and heavy swell.
postscript|GENERIC||None||SMS marketing revenue platform for ecommerce|messaging marketing SaaS, no matching proof point|SMS revenue depends on send timing and audience selection that avoids burning subscribers through fatigue.
joy|GENERIC||None||Planning platform for weddings and life events|consumer event software, no matching proof point|Event planning apps succeed when guest data flows cleanly from invites to RSVPs to seating.
